                   octonions~$\mathbb{O}$.  See also A.~Hurwitz, ``{\"U}ber die
                   Komposition der quadratischen Formen,'' Math.~Ann.~88 (1923) 1--25
                   (posthumous; DOI: \texttt{10.1007/bf01448439}).
                   Available via EUDML: \url{http://eudml.org/doc/58420}.}
}

